message: "If you use BigContext Schema, please cite it as below."
title: "BigContext Schema"
abstract: >-
  An open specification for writing down business context (rules, procedures, organizations, metric and data
  definitions, mappings and decisions) as statements, each tied to the exact words of the source it came from.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Big Context & Company"
version: "1.0.1"
date-released: "2026-10-30"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/BigContext-OpenSource/bigcontext-schema"
url: "https://w3id.org/bigcontext-schema"
keywords:
  - business context
  - knowledge graph
  - LinkML
  - semantic layer
  - AI agents
